                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_freeze_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(30)" name="jfg_fly_freeze" data-checked="fly_freeze" value="0" id="jfg_fly_freeze_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_freeze_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(31)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Hide HUD While Flying</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(31)" name="jfg_fly_hide_hud" data-checked="fly_hide_hud" value="1" id="jfg_fly_hide_hud_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_freeze_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_shoulder_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_hide_hud_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(31)" name="jfg_fly_hide_hud" data-checked="fly_hide_hud" value="0" id="jfg_fly_hide_hud_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_freeze_off; nav-down: #jfg_aim_shoulder_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_hide_hud_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden"><div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Aiming View</label></div></div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(32)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Over-the-Shoulder Aiming</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(32)" name="jfg_aim_shoulder" data-checked="aim_shoulder" value="1" id="jfg_aim_shoulder_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_on; " data-style-nav-down="aim_shoulder == 1 ? 'none' : '#jfg_aim_drag_margin_input'"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_shoulder_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(32)" name="jfg_aim_shoulder" data-checked="aim_shoulder" value="0" id="jfg_aim_shoulder_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_off; " data-style-nav-down="aim_shoulder == 1 ? 'none' : '#jfg_aim_drag_margin_input'"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_aim_shoulder_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(33)" data-style-opacity="aim_shoulder == 1 ? '0.4' : '1'">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Drag Margin</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_drag_margin}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(33)" id="jfg_aim_drag_margin_input" type="range" min="0" max="50" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_shoulder_on; nav-down: #jfg_aim_drag_return_input;" data-value="aim_drag_margin" data-attrif-disabled="aim_shoulder == 1"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(34)" data-style-opacity="aim_shoulder == 1 ? '0.4' : '1'">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Drag Return Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_drag_return}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(34)" id="jfg_aim_drag_return_input" type="range" min="0" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_drag_margin_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_offset_x_input;" data-value="aim_drag_return" data-attrif-disabled="aim_shoulder == 1"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(35)" data-style-opacity="aim_shoulder == 1 ? '0.4' : '1'">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Offset Left/Right</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_offset_x}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(35)" id="jfg_aim_offset_x_input" type="range" min="-50" max="50" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_drag_return_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_offset_y_input;" data-value="aim_offset_x" data-attrif-disabled="aim_shoulder == 1"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(36)" data-style-opacity="aim_shoulder == 1 ? '0.4' : '1'">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Offset Up/Down</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_offset_y}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(36)" id="jfg_aim_offset_y_input" type="range" min="-50" max="50" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_offset_x_input; nav-down: #jfg_aim_offset_z_input;" data-value="aim_offset_y" data-attrif-disabled="aim_shoulder == 1"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-if="!advanced_hidden">
                    <div class="config-option jfg-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(37)" data-style-opacity="aim_shoulder == 1 ? '0.4' : '1'">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Aim Zoom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{aim_offset_z}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(37)" id="jfg_aim_offset_z_input" type="range" min="0" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_aim_offset_y_input; nav-down: none;" data-value="aim_offset_z" data-attrif-disabled="aim_shoulder == 1"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <!-- Descriptions -->
                <div class="config__wrapper jfg-desc">
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 0"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Window Mode</div><p><b>Windowed</b> or <b>Fullscreen</b>. <b>F11</b> or <b>Alt + Enter</b> also switch it.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 1"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Resolution</div><p>The resolution the game is drawn at. <b>Original</b>: the game's own 240p. <b>Original 2x</b>: 480p. <b>Auto</b>: follows the size of the window.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 2"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Downsampling</div><p>Draws at a higher resolution and scales it down for a cleaner picture. Only with the <b>Original</b> and <b>Original 2x</b> resolutions. <b>4x</b> at <b>Original 2x</b> draws at almost 4K and may be slow on low-end graphics cards.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 3"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Anti-Aliasing (MSAA)</div><p>Multisample anti-aliasing: smoother edges at the cost of rendering performance. Not available if your graphics card does not support programmable sample positions (needed to avoid rendering glitches).</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 4"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Display Frame Rate</div><p>How many frames a second you see. Above the game's own, the renderer adds in-between frames: movement looks smoother, with a little more delay, but the game itself runs no faster. <b>Monitor</b>: up to your monitor's refresh rate; never more than it. Rain and a few effects still move at the game's rate. A lower setting takes less from the graphics card.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 5"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Smooth Shadows</div><p>With <b>Display Frame Rate</b>, character shadows move with the in-between frames instead of at the game's rate, so they no longer trail behind the character.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 6"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Widescreen</div><p>During gameplay the 3D view fills the window; the HUD stays in the middle. Things at the far left and right may appear late.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 7"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">HUD in Screen Corners</div><p>With <b>Widescreen</b>, the HUD moves from the middle out to the left and right edges of the window.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 8"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Field of View</div><p>Widens or narrows the view during gameplay, relative to each level's own field of view. Cutscenes, menus, the pause screen and zoomed scopes keep the game's own.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 9"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Texture Filtering</div><p><b>N64 Three-Point</b>: how the N64 smooths textures. <b>Bilinear</b>: smoother, as on PC.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 10"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Picture Scaling</div><p>How the picture is scaled to the window. <b>Anti-Aliased</b>: sharp pixels with smooth edges. <b>Linear</b>: softer. <b>Nearest</b>: sharp pixels.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 11"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Hit Flash Opacity</div><p>How strongly the screen turns red when your character is hit. 100% is the original game; 0% turns the red flash off.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 12"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Shadow Opacity</div><p>How dark the shadows under characters and objects are drawn. 100% is the original game; 0% turns them off.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 13"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Disable LOD</div><p>Characters and objects keep their full-detail model at any distance.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 14"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Draw Distant Objects</div><p>Objects no longer fade out and disappear beyond their draw distance. Level scenery itself is not affected.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 15"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Ambient Occlusion (SSAO)</div><p>Darkens creases, corners and the ground around objects, worked out from the depth of the 3D view. The HUD is not affected.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 16"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">SSAO Strength</div><p>How dark the ambient occlusion gets.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 17"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">SSAO Radius</div><p>How far around a surface ambient occlusion looks, in game units.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 18"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Bloom</div><p>Bright parts of the 3D view (lights, explosions, sky, shots) glow softly into their surroundings. The HUD does not glow.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 19"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Bloom Intensity</div><p>How strong the glow is.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 20"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Bloom Threshold</div><p>How bright a colour must be to glow. Lower: more of the picture glows.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 21"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Bloom Radius</div><p>How far the glow spreads.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 22"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Vignette</div><p>Darkens the edges and corners of the 3D view. The HUD is not darkened.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 23"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Vignette Strength</div><p>How dark the corners get.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 24"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Vignette Size</div><p>How far from the middle the darkening starts: higher keeps more of the picture clear.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 25"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Level Fog Distance</div><p>How far away the levels' own fog is. Some levels use it to hide where the scenery stops being drawn, so moving it back can show things appearing in the distance.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 26"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">No Level Fog</div><p>Turns the levels' own fog off. Things in the distance may be seen appearing.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 27"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Show Advanced Options</div><p>Settings most players can leave as they are: the game's own update rate (60 is experimental), the fly camera (F7) and the aiming view's sliders. <b>On</b> shows them below.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 28"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Game Frame Rate</div><p>How many times a second the game itself updates: movement, aiming, enemies. <b>30 (Original)</b>: like the N64 (it drops to 20 when busy). <b>60</b>: the quickest response; game speed stays the same. 60 is experimental: some enemies and bosses can behave differently than at 30. Choose <b>30</b> for the original game.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 29"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Fly Speed</div><p>F7 (or F10 > Tools) flies a free camera for screenshots: WASD / left stick move where it looks, mouse / right stick look, Space / A up, Ctrl / B down, holding fire flies faster. F7 again ends it.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 30"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Freeze While Flying</div><p>The game stands still while the fly camera is on (enemies, effects and the level stop as when paused).</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 31"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Hide HUD While Flying</div><p>The health meter and the rest of the HUD are hidden while the fly camera is on.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 32"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Over-the-Shoulder Aiming</div><p>While aiming, the view is from over the character's right shoulder. With the dual stick this sets the aiming view's sliders below to a fixed shoulder view (greyed out); off, they are yours to set.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 33"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Drag Margin</div><p>Dual stick, aiming: how far the character may step aside from the middle of the screen before the camera follows, as a share of half the screen's width. 0 keeps the camera on the character. Fixed while Over-the-Shoulder Aiming is on.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 34"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Drag Return Speed</div><p>Dual stick, aiming: how fast the camera keeps coming back onto the character, moving or not. 100% takes about a third of a second; 0 leaves it where it is. Fixed while Over-the-Shoulder Aiming is on.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 35"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Offset Left/Right</div><p>Dual stick, aiming: the point the camera turns round moves this far to the right of the character (negative: left), so the view can look past a shoulder. Fixed while Over-the-Shoulder Aiming is on.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 36"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Offset Up/Down</div><p>Dual stick, aiming: the point the camera turns round moves this far up from the middle of the character (negative: down). Fixed while Over-the-Shoulder Aiming is on.</p></div></div>
                    <div data-if="cur_config_index == 37"><div class="jfg-desc__card"><div class="jfg-desc__title">Aim Zoom</div><p>Dual stick, aiming: the camera moves this much closer in. Fixed while Over-the-Shoulder Aiming is on.</p></div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </body>
</template>
